{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/collections/data-protection-act-2018","content_id":"72ef0377-4c10-4452-b0a8-e727d36bed39","description":"The Data Protection Act updates our data protection laws for the digital age. It received Royal Assent on 23 May 2018. ","details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Digital technology has transformed almost every aspect of our lives in the twenty years since the last Data Protection Act was passed.</p>\n\n<p>Our new Data Protection Act:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>makes our data protection laws fit for the digital age in which an ever increasing amount of data is being processed</li>\n  <li>empowers people to take control of their data</li>\n  <li>supports UK businesses and organisations through the change</li>\n  <li>ensures that the UK is prepared for the future after we have left the EU</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The text of the Data Protection Act and related documents can be found <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2018/12/pdfs/ukpga_20180012_en.pdf\" class=\"govuk-link\">here</a> on legislation.gov.uk. Historical documents relating to <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://services.parliament.uk/bills/2017-19/dataprotection.html\" class=\"govuk-link\">the passage of the Act</a> can be found on the Parliament website.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added National Security Certificates guidance.","public_timestamp":"2020-08-19T10:53:52Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2018-05-22T23:00:00Z"}],"collection_groups":[{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n</div>","documents":["96fc0990-f444-41ff-a7fd-4e7a78cdb4db","cf9a056a-86b1-428c-adfc-b2615a10607b","6cf1bd11-8535-402f-9c61-50759449bda7","9cb10e24-8e3e-4e9c-a6ad-6d8e6857b756","c09dc7e6-bf03-4614-a65f-6610d03550d6","2c75574c-d572-40c4-af8b-7f2dc8b1e417"],"title":"Documents"}],"emphasised_organisations":["c352c234-8083-47ec-8a4b-0edd45c31263","06056197-bc69-4147-aa28-070bca132178"],"first_public_at":"2018-05-23T00:00:00.000+01:00",